   "text": "Examples"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1. 毎日運動したのに、全然痩せなかった。\nDespite exercising every day, I didn't get thinner."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2. 学生なのに、彼女は勉強しない。\nDespite being a student, she does not study."
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
