   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Vocabulary"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1. デパート - department store"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2. 行く【い・く】(u-verb) - to go"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "3. 何【なに〜なん】- what"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4. 全然【ぜん・ぜん】- not at all (when used with negative)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5. 欲しい【ほ・しい】(i-adj) - desirable"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "6. 友達【とも・だち】- friend"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "7. 聞く【き・く】(u-verb) - to ask; to listen"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "8. 知る【し・る】(u-verb) - to know"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "9. 今日【きょう】- today"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "10. 暇【ひま】- free (as in not busy)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "11. 明日【あした】- tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "12. 忙しい【いそが・しい】(i-adj) - busy"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "13. 彼【かれ】- he; boyfriend"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "14. まだ - yet"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "15. 好き【す・き】(na-adj) - likable; desirable"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "16. いい (i-adj) - good"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "17. 物【もの】- object"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "18. たくさん - a lot (amount)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "19. ある (u-verb) - to exist (inanimate)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "20. 見る【み・る】(ru-verb) - to see"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "21. 面白い【おも・しろ・い】(i-adj) - interesting"
